 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 21.69,
   "end": 26.79,
   "text": "One of my favorite things about being an epidemiologist is just the variety to the job."
  },
  {
   "start": 26.79,
   "end": 33.73,
   "text": "There's never a boring day, and really being able to go after those answers to research questions."
  },
  {
   "start": 33.73,
   "end": 37.46,
   "text": "That I myself can go out and try to find the answers."
  },
  {
   "start": 37.46,
   "end": 39.64,
   "text": "And I absolutely love my job."
  },
  {
   "start": 39.64,
   "end": 42.79,
   "text": "I feel like I'm doing a good thing."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.79,
   "end": 45.09,
   "text": "I'm impacting, potentially, workers' lives."
  },
  {
   "start": 45.09,
   "end": 47.36,
   "text": "There's just no price you can put on that."
  },
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 5.63,
   "text": "She really helped me with statistics, but more than that, she said, look you need to be a research assistant."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.94,
   "end": 7.26,
   "text": "You need to get into the honors program."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.26,
   "end": 8.55,
   "text": "You need to be a teaching assistant."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.55,
   "end": 11.35,
   "text": "Here are the things you need to do to go forward."
  },
  {
   "start": 11.35,
   "end": 14.55,
   "text": "And without her, I don't think I would have done well."
  },
  {
   "start": 14.55,
   "end": 18.06,
   "text": "I don't think I would have stayed in science."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.06,
   "end": 19.72,
   "text": "She really had a huge impact on my life."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.73,
   "end": 21.61,
   "text": "When I was thinking about a Ph.D."
  }
 ],
